==================================================================================
CONCLUSION
==================================================================================
  Regime A splits into PRINCIPAL-LIKE (clean lcm slope law, j>=D/14 PROVABLE from
  private-q arithmetic) and NON-PRINCIPAL (j set by the full small-part alignment,
  private-q insufficient). The literal HYP-2579 conjecture 'private-q => j>=D/14' is
  TRUE-but-tautological at the M-crossing, PROVABLE-non-tautologically ONLY on the
  principal-like sub-family, and FALSE as a per-record arithmetic statement (part 1).
